# Normalise line endings on checkout everywhere.
#
# Without this, each checkout follows its own core.autocrlf -- which is true on
# the windows-latest runner image, so every .cs file lands with CRLF while
# .editorconfig declares `end_of_line = lf` for [*.cs]. `dotnet format whitespace
# --verify-no-changes` then flags every line of every file on the Windows CI leg.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary assets: never touch these, and never diff them as text.
*.png  binary
*.jpg  binary
*.ico  binary
*.ttf  binary
*.wav  binary
